# Tutors Monorepo Architecture

**A Comprehensive Workspace for Educational Content**

Version 1.0.0 • July 2026

---

# Overview

The **Tutors Monorepo** unifies the complete educational platform ecosystem:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         Tutors Monorepo Ecosystem               │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  📦 JSR Packages     (Course Generation)        │
│  🎨 Svelte Packages  (UI & Services)            │
│  🌐 Applications     (Reader, Catalogue, Live)  │
│  ⚡ Services         (Real-time Infrastructure) │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Single source of truth for course generation, content delivery, and educational features

---

# Key Capabilities

**Course Generation** 📝
- Transform markdown → structured JSON/HTML
- CLI tools for content authors

**Course Reading** 📖
- Interactive web viewer
- Real-time presence tracking
- Analytics & engagement metrics

**Platform Features** ✨
- Multi-language support (i18n)
- Accessibility (dyslexia fonts, reduced motion)
- GitHub OAuth authentication
- Live WebSocket collaboration

---

