# Technology Stack

---

# Core Technologies

| Category | Technologies |
|----------|-------------|
| **Package Management** | pnpm 8+, Vite 8.x, TypeScript 5+ |
| **Runtime** | Deno (JSR), Node.js 18+, Browser |
| **Frontend** | Svelte 5, SvelteKit 2, Tailwind CSS 4, Skeleton UI 5 |
| **Content** | markdown-it, Shiki, Marp, Mermaid, PDF.js |
| **Backend** | Supabase, PartyKit, Auth.js |

