# 1. Model Package

**`@tutors/tutors-model-lib`** - Core Data Structures

**Purpose**: Foundation types used across the ecosystem

```typescript
interface Lo {           // Learning Object
  type: string;          // "course" | "topic" | "lab" | etc.
  title: string;
  route: string;         // URL path
  los?: Lo[];           // Child objects
}

interface Course extends Lo {
  url: string;           // Base URL for assets
  topicIndex: Map<string, Lo>;
  labIndex: Map<string, Lo>;
}
```

---

# Model Package Structure

```
packages/jsr/model/src/
├── types/
│   ├── learning-objects.ts   # Lo, Course, Topic
│   ├── icon-types.ts          # Icon configs
│   ├── media-types.ts         # Video, PDF
│   └── calendar-types.ts
├── utils/
│   ├── lo-utils.ts
│   ├── course-utils.ts
│   ├── markdown-utils.ts
│   └── markdown-plugins.ts
└── services/
    ├── lo-tree.ts             # Tree traversal
    └── search.ts
```

