# 2. Time Package

**`@tutors/tutors-time-lib`** - Analytics & Tracking

**Key Services**:
```typescript
interface TutorsTime {
  logLearningEvent(event: LearningEvent): Promise<void>;
  getCourseMetrics(courseId: string): Promise<Metrics>;
}

interface LearningEvent {
  userId: string;
  courseId: string;
  loRoute: string;
  timestamp: Date;
  duration?: number;
}
```

**Features**: Calendar models, lab analytics, Supabase integration

