# 3. Gen Package

**`@tutors/tutors-gen-lib`** - Course Generation

**Generation Pipeline**:
```
Markdown Files
      ↓
CourseBuilder     (scan folders, identify types)
      ↓
ResourceBuilder   (extract metadata, parse content)
      ↓
TemplateEngine    (render with Vento - HTML mode)
      ↓
CourseEmitter     (output JSON or HTML)
      ↓
Deployable Output
```

---

# Content Folder Convention

```
my-course/
├── properties.yaml         # Course metadata
├── topic-01/
│   ├── properties.yaml     # Topic metadata
│   ├── unit-1/
│   │   ├── book-a/         # Lab (folder)
│   │   │   ├── book-a.md   # Overview
│   │   │   ├── 01.md       # Step 1
│   │   │   ├── 02.md       # Step 2
│   │   │   └── archives/
│   │   ├── talk-1.md       # Talk
│   │   └── video-1.md      # Video
│   └── unit-2/...
└── topic-02/...
```

---

