# 1. Runes Package

**`@tutors/runes`** - Reactive State Management

**Global State with Svelte 5 Runes**:
```typescript
export const currentCourse: {
  get value(): Course | null;
  set value(v: Course | null);
};

export const currentLo: {
  get value(): Lo | null;
  set value(v: Lo | null);
};

export const layout: {
  get value(): "expanded" | "compacted";
  set value(v: "expanded" | "compacted");
};
```

---

# Runes Implementation

**Why `.svelte.ts`?** Svelte compiler must process `$state`

```typescript
// index.svelte.ts
const rune = <T>(initialValue: T) => {
  let _rune = $state(initialValue);
  return {
    get value() { return _rune; },
    set value(v: T) { _rune = v; }
  };
};

// Lazy initialization (SSR-safe)
let _currentCourse: ReturnType<typeof rune<Course | null>> | null = null;

export const currentCourse = {
  get value() { return (_currentCourse ??= rune(null)).value; },
  set value(v) { (_currentCourse ??= rune(null)).value = v; }
};
```

---

# 2. Course Package

**`@tutors/course`** - Course Processing & Markdown

**Key Services**:
- **Course Service** - Fetches JSON, caches courses, manages labs
- **Live Lab** - Lab step navigation, markdown fetching
- **Live Notebook** - Jupyter notebook rendering
- **Markdown Service** - Markdown → HTML, Shiki, Mermaid, Marp

**Flow**:
```
courseService.readCourse(id, fetch)
  → Fetch tutors.json
  → Decorate tree
  → Cache
  → Update runes
  → Components re-render
```

---

# 3. Themes Package

**`@tutors/themes`** - UI Theming & Styles

**Features**:
- Display modes (light/dark)
- Icon sets (Fluent, Hero, Easter, Festive)
- Layouts (expanded/compacted)
- Card styles (portrait/landscape/circular)
- Festive mode (snow animation)

**Service API**:
```typescript
themeService.toggleDisplayMode();
themeService.setIconSet("fluent");
themeService.getIcon("lab");
```

---

# 4. Community Package

**`@tutors/community`** - Analytics & Presence

**Sub-services**:
- **Analytics Service** - Page views to Supabase
- **Presence Service** - Course-specific tracking
- **Live Service** - Platform-wide activity
- **Catalogue Service** - Course directory

**Integration**: Supabase (storage) + PartyKit (real-time)

---

# 5. Connect Package

**`@tutors/connect`** - Authentication

- GitHub OAuth via Auth.js
- User profile management
- Session persistence
- Course access control

---

# 6. UI Package

**`@tutors/ui`** - Reusable Components

**Categories**:
- **components/** - Generic (Icon, Menu, Sidebar)
- **learning-objects/** - Lab, Video, Talk, Notebook
  - content/, layout/, structure/
- **navigators/** - Buttons, footers, titles
- **time/** - Analytics UI

**Learning Object Renderers**: Lab, Talk, Video, Note, Notebook, Wall

