# 1. Reader App

**`apps/reader`** - Main Course Reader

**Route Groups**:
```
routes/
├── (auth)/                  # Authentication
├── (course-reader)/         # Course content
│   ├── course/[courseid]/
│   ├── topic/[courseid]/[...loid]/
│   ├── lab/[courseid]/[...loid]/
│   ├── talk/[courseid]/[...loid]/
│   ├── video/[courseid]/[...loid]/
│   ├── time/[courseid]/     # Analytics
│   └── search/[courseid]/
└── (home)/                  # Landing page
```

---

# Reader Environment Modes

**Anonymous Mode** (no backend):
```env
PUBLIC_ANON_MODE=TRUE
```

**Full Mode** (with services):
```env
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=...
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=...
PUBLIC_party_kit_main_room=...
PRIVATE_AUTH_GITHUB_ID=...
PRIVATE_AUTH_GITHUB_SECRET=...
```

