# Data Flow

---

# Complete Content Pipeline

```
Author Creates Content (Markdown)
        ↓
tutors-cli (Deno)
        ↓
@tutors/tutors-gen-lib processes
        ↓
json/tutors.json generated
        ↓
Deploy to CDN
        ↓
Reader App fetches
        ↓
courseService decorates
        ↓
UI components render
        ↓
Analytics tracked
        ↓
Real-time via PartyKit
```

---

# State Management Flow

```
User Action (click card)
        ↓
Event Handler
        ↓
courseService.readLab()
        ↓
Fetch & process data
        ↓
Update rune: currentLo.value = lab
        ↓
$effect(() => { ... }) triggers
        ↓
Components re-render
        ↓
UI updates
```

---

# Analytics Flow

```
User views page
        ↓
analyticsService.reportPageLoad(lo)
        ↓
        ├─► Supabase (persistent)
        │   - Insert learning_event
        │   - Update session
        │
        └─► PartyKit (real-time)
            - Broadcast to room
            - Other clients update
            - Live view shows activity
```

