# Dependency Graph

---

# Package Dependencies (Bottom-Up)

```
Applications
    ↓
@tutors/ui
    ↓
@tutors/community, @tutors/connect, @tutors/themes
    ↓
@tutors/course, @tutors/i18n, @tutors/a11y
    ↓
@tutors/runes, @tutors/logger
    ↓
@tutors/tutors-model-lib, @tutors/tutors-time-lib
```

---

# Dependency Layers

| Layer | Packages | Dependencies |
|-------|----------|-------------|
| **0** | model, time, logger | None |
| **1** | runes | → model |
| **2** | course, a11y, i18n | → runes, logger, model |
| **3** | themes, community | → course + lower |
| **4** | connect | → community, course |
| **5** | ui | → all packages |
| **6** | apps | → ui + others |

