# Development Workflow

---

# Getting Started

```bash
# Clone repository
cd /path/to/tutors-mono-repo

# Install all dependencies
pnpm install

# Start reader app
cd apps/reader
pnpm dev
# → http://localhost:5173
```

**pnpm Workspaces**: Single install, `workspace:*` linking, fast

---

# Development Commands

**Run specific app**:
```bash
pnpm --filter reader dev
pnpm --filter catalogue dev
pnpm --filter live dev
```

**Build/check packages**:
```bash
pnpm --filter @tutors/ui build
pnpm --filter @tutors/course check
pnpm -r check      # All packages
```

---

# Hot Module Replacement

**Vite provides instant updates**:

✅ Svelte components reload on save
✅ CSS updates without page refresh
✅ Service changes trigger re-import
✅ Fast iteration cycle

**Preserves**: Component state, browser position, form inputs

---

<!-- _class: lead -->

# Deployment

---

# JSR Package Publishing

```bash
# Single package
cd packages/jsr/model
deno publish

# All JSR packages
for pkg in packages/jsr/*; do
  cd $pkg && deno publish && cd -
done
```

**Consumption**:
```typescript
// Deno
import { type Course } from "jsr:@tutors/tutors-model-lib@^5.0";

// Node.js
import { type Course } from "@tutors/tutors-model-lib";
```

---

# Application Deployment

**Reader App**:
```bash
cd apps/reader
pnpm build  # → build/
```

**Adapter Auto-Detection**:
- Netlify → adapter-netlify
- Vercel → adapter-vercel
- Cloudflare → adapter-cloudflare
- Fallback → adapter-node

**Environment Variables**: Set in platform dashboard

---

# Course Deployment

```bash
# 1. Generate
cd /path/to/course-source
deno run -A jsr:@tutors/reader

# 2. Deploy json/ folder
cd json
netlify deploy --prod
```

**Requirements**: Static hosting, CORS headers, HTTPS

---

# PartyKit Deployment

```bash
cd services/party
npx partykit deploy
```

**Configuration** (`partykit.json`):
```json
{
  "name": "tutors",
  "main": "src/server.ts"
}
```

**Result**: WebSocket endpoint, auto-scaling, global edge

---

<!-- _class: lead -->

# Key Benefits

---

# Monorepo Advantages

**🎯 Single Source of Truth**
- All packages versioned together
- No version mismatch issues
- Unified dependency management

**⚡ Fast Development**
- HMR across packages
- No publishing for local changes
- Type safety across boundaries

**🔧 Easy Refactoring**
- Change types in one place
- Update all consumers atomically

---

# Design Principles

**Bottom-Up Dependencies**
- Lower layers never depend on higher
- Clear separation of concerns

**Package Isolation**
- Single responsibility per package
- Minimal public API

**Shared Types**
- JSR packages define core types
- Svelte packages consume types
- Type safety across ecosystem

---

<!-- _class: lead -->

# Summary

---

# Repository Structure Recap

```
tutors-mono-repo/
├── packages/jsr/        # 4 JSR packages
│   └── model, time, gen, tutors
├── packages/svelte/     # 9 Svelte packages
│   └── runes, course, themes, community,
│      connect, ui, utils (logger, a11y, i18n)
├── apps/                # 3 Applications
│   └── reader, catalogue, live
└── services/            # 1 Service
    └── party
```

**Total**: 17 packages + 3 apps + 1 service

---

# Key Workflows

**Content Creation**:
Markdown → tutors-cli → JSON → CDN → Reader

**State Management**:
Runes ($state) → Services → Components → UI

**Analytics**:
Events → Supabase (storage) + PartyKit (real-time)

**Authentication**:
GitHub OAuth → Auth.js → Connect Service → Apps

